    "description": "Final Project Presentation: 50.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISP490 · Assessment 2/2</span>\n<h2>Final Project Presentation:</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14067 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISP490 · Đầu điểm 2/2</span>\n<h2>Final Project Presentation:</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14067 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">Final exam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">50.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">~ 30 minutes for presentation, ~ 60 minutes for demo and Q&amp;A. Total is 90 minutes.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">All LOs</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">CP Project Presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Thesis Defense Assessment (TDA):<br><br>- Project Introduction: 5%<br><br>- Project Management Plan: 5%<br><br>- Software Requirement: 15%<br><br>- Software Design: 10%<br><br>- Testing: 10%<br><br>- User Guides: 5%<br><br>- Implementation: 35%<br><br>- Presentation Skills: 5%<br><br>- Q&amp;A: 10%<br><br>Presentation mark is given by each member of defence committee for each student on final project presentation. Personal mark is the average of all marks given by members of defence committee.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">One or more specific members of the student team is not allowed to join the thesis defense (and therefore being failed the subject) if he/she has OGA less than 5 or any cheating found from him/her (he/she can't prove they do the software product by him/herself).<br><br>Before thesis defense, the student team must wait until the second round of thesis defense if the whole team has the OGA less than 5/10 OR they are in one of below cases:<br><br>(1) The team completes less than 75% use cases functions/screens as submitted (as mentioned in the submitted Report 3, at the end of the week 3) OR there are less than 20 average (3-7 transactions) use cases completed.<br><br>(2) The team can't prove the fact that they prepare any of the project reports or the output software package by themselves<br><br>(3) There are more than 3 obvious coding-logic defects OR more than 1 show-stopper defects (the defects that prevent end user from completing his/her use case on any software functions) in the submitted software.<br><br>The student(s) has to re-do the capstone project if the above cases occur with the assessments for the second thesis defense OR there is one OGA with grade less than 2/10.<br><br>After thesis defense, one or more team members are evaluated as failed the capstone project if they are in one of below cases (no matter when the guiding teacher doesn't evaluate that):<br><br>(1) Student can't demonstrate any function or use case<br><br>(2) Students can't prove the fact that they prepare any of the project reports or the output software by themselves<br><br>(3) There are more than 3 obvious coding-logic defects OR more than 1 show-stopper defects (the defects that prevent end user from completing his/her use case on any software functions) in the submitted software.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 2 — Team Weekly Meeting: CP Topic Review &amp; Group Division</li><li>Session 3 — Team Weekly Meeting: Project Plan Review</li><li>Session 4 — Team Weekly Meeting: Project &amp; SRS Review</li><li>Session 14 — Team Weekly Meeting: Project &amp; Software Package Review</li><li>Session 15 — Team Weekly Meeting: Practice for Presentation of Capstone Project</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 2 — Team Weekly Meeting: CP Topic Review &amp; Group Division</li><li>Buổi 3 — Team Weekly Meeting: Project Plan Review</li><li>Buổi 4 — Team Weekly Meeting: Project &amp; SRS Review</li><li>Buổi 14 — Team Weekly Meeting: Project &amp; Software Package Review</li><li>Buổi 15 — Team Weekly Meeting: Practice for Presentation of Capstone Project</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
